{"messages":[{"text":"🇪🇸 Torres defiende trasladar a cerca de 1.000 migrantes de las calles de Ceuta a espacios cerrados para agilizar su identificación y, cuando proceda, su devolución a Marruecos.\n🌶️ De la calle al expediente: Ceuta cambia campamento por ventanilla.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20Torres%20defiende%20trasladar%20a%20cerca%20de%201.000%20migrantes%20de%20las%20calles%20de%20Ceuta%20a%20espacios%20cerrados%20para%20agilizar%20su%20identificaci%C3%B3n%20y%2C%20cuando%20proceda%2C%20su%20devoluci%C3%B3n%20a%20Marruecos.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20De%20la%20calle%20al%20expediente%3A%20Ceuta%20cambia%20campamento%20por%20ventanilla."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20Torres%20defiende%20trasladar%20a%20cerca%20de%201.000%20migrantes%20de%20las%20calles%20de%20Ceuta%20a%20espacios%20cerrados%20para%20agilizar%20su%20identificaci%C3%B3n%20y%2C%20cuando%20proceda%2C%20su%20devoluci%C3%B3n%20a%20Marruecos.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20El%20Gobierno%20acelera%20la%20devoluci%C3%B3n%20empezando%20por%20poner%20techo%20al%20atasco."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20Torres%20defiende%20trasladar%20a%20cerca%20de%201.000%20migrantes%20de%20las%20calles%20de%20Ceuta%20a%20espacios%20cerrados%20para%20agilizar%20su%20identificaci%C3%B3n%20y%2C%20cuando%20proceda%2C%20su%20devoluci%C3%B3n%20a%20Marruecos.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Operaci%C3%B3n%20normalidad%3A%20techo%20primero%2C%20papeleo%20despu%C3%A9s."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AA%F0%9F%87%B8%20Torres%20defiende%20trasladar%20a%20cerca%20de%201.000%20migrantes%20de%20las%20calles%20de%20Ceuta%20a%20espacios%20cerrados%20para%20agilizar%20su%20identificaci%C3%B3n%20y%2C%20cuando%20proceda%2C%20su%20devoluci%C3%B3n%20a%20Marruecos.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%E